server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:28:          "aspirations": "Yusuf feels isolated and unsupported. The Mammon Cult (MMN) is in formative stage, but I dont really have any surety to bother building it up just for someone else to take. At the same time I have not been subtle with its presence. The cult served its initial purpose - the contrivance to get me to Sydney. It stands out as a target. Perhaps I will set it up at this stage as a honey-pot to lure investigation and actions of other kindred. I see the cult as a presently useful expendable asset.\n\nI am guest everywhere, marginalised even in the Covenant. Yusuf has a job here in Sydney - to protect Brandy. But he sees both her and Eve witless puppets on a string of more organised powers. A dangerous predicament. Yusuf must help himself first. Hence taking OBS5. And working on his lair. Mt plans are to get safe and embedded. This court seems like a dangerours and specially curated fishbowl designed to fail. I worry about the consequences for the Carthian Movement. I fear we have been trojan horsed by Eve with a plan to humiliate the movement on the global stage as the \"Carthian Experiment\" fails spectacularly.\n\nIt is unlikely building clan status within the Carthians will be viable. They are riven, misguided and working against their own interests. Eve has already cleverly seen to that. Handing out boons to those who are giddy with the proximity to praxis and ignoring those not actively bending knee. The younger Carthians in the movement seem enthusiastic to embrace a \"lets see hoe THEY like it attitude, rather than a lets do this properly\".\n\nThe City status game is meta-unstable and already stitched up. There are inner and outer cliques quickly forming and Yusuf sees no way into the inner cliques. So Yusuf must build.... \nwith what he has left in the space left to him. THE SEWERS.\n\nThe sewers and catacombs in the territory no one bothered wanting... with his Clan - the Nosferatu. There are not many Nos, and they don't usually play well - not with others and not with themselves. I will make a place in the catacombs. I will open it to others of my kind. I will see who will come to the Necropolis once it is built. The first bricks are laid in this downtime.\n\nSHORT: GET MYSELF SAFE\nMEDIUM: BUILD THE NOS, PROTECT MMN\nLONG: NECROPOLIS UNDER THEIR FEET"
server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:153:            "description": "The network of influence in Politics and Finance that is the MMN cult reaps its rewards in greased palms. The right bribe, the right contract, the right environmental report. Volia - whole chunks of subterranean tunnels sealed off with special works here - accidental concrete spill there, sealed off for the M11 tunnel. Tunnels, mostly bare, ugly, damp, infested. But directly underneath and nowhere all at once! It is a patchwork of forgotten RTA service tunnels, WW2 shuttered ammunition tunnels, redundant storm-water catchment sumps, etc... It is not ownership per se. It is sealing the entry points off little clusters and burying them administratively so they are nobody's business.",
server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:196:        "aspirations": "Yusuf feels isolated and unsupported. The Mammon Cult (MMN) is in formative stage, but I dont really have any surety to bother building it up just for someone else to take. At the same time I have not been subtle with its presence. The cult served its initial purpose - the contrivance to get me to Sydney. It stands out as a target. Perhaps I will set it up at this stage as a honey-pot to lure investigation and actions of other kindred. I see the cult as a presently useful expendable asset.\n\nI am guest everywhere, marginalised even in the Covenant. Yusuf has a job here in Sydney - to protect Brandy. But he sees both her and Eve witless puppets on a string of more organised powers. A dangerous predicament. Yusuf must help himself first. Hence taking OBS5. And working on his lair. Mt plans are to get safe and embedded. This court seems like a dangerours and specially curated fishbowl designed to fail. I worry about the consequences for the Carthian Movement. I fear we have been trojan horsed by Eve with a plan to humiliate the movement on the global stage as the \"Carthian Experiment\" fails spectacularly.\n\nIt is unlikely building clan status within the Carthians will be viable. They are riven, misguided and working against their own interests. Eve has already cleverly seen to that. Handing out boons to those who are giddy with the proximity to praxis and ignoring those not actively bending knee. The younger Carthians in the movement seem enthusiastic to embrace a \"lets see hoe THEY like it attitude, rather than a lets do this properly\".\n\nThe City status game is meta-unstable and already stitched up. There are inner and outer cliques quickly forming and Yusuf sees no way into the inner cliques. So Yusuf must build.... \nwith what he has left in the space left to him. THE SEWERS.\n\nThe sewers and catacombs in the territory no one bothered wanting... with his Clan - the Nosferatu. There are not many Nos, and they don't usually play well - not with others and not with themselves. I will make a place in the catacombs. I will open it to others of my kind. I will see who will come to the Necropolis once it is built. The first bricks are laid in this downtime.\n\nSHORT: GET MYSELF SAFE\nMEDIUM: BUILD THE NOS, PROTECT MMN\nLONG: NECROPOLIS UNDER THEIR FEET",
server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:243:        "sphere_3_description": "The network of influence in Politics and Finance that is the MMN cult reaps its rewards in greased palms. The right bribe, the right contract, the right environmental report. Volia - whole chunks of subterranean tunnels sealed off with special works here - accidental concrete spill there, sealed off for the M11 tunnel. Tunnels, mostly bare, ugly, damp, infested. But directly underneath and nowhere all at once! It is a patchwork of forgotten RTA service tunnels, WW2 shuttered ammunition tunnels, redundant storm-water catchment sumps, etc... It is not ownership per se. It is sealing the entry points off little clusters and burying them administratively so they are nobody's business.",
server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:1481:          "game_recount": "- Sat in a corner a lot and did handicrafts. Now all the Crone present (and Charlie) have ribbons from the hunt. Alice helped, so she'll be in any resonance from them, too.\n- Shook hands with a lot of people, especially some of the newcomers\n- Met the Bishop, that was hilarious\n- Met the Keeper's LS interest, Carver. He's interesting, and only here to learn about the past. A bit like me on that one. Mentioned the old Altar. May wanna touch base about that\n- Talked to Tegan ha ha she was not happy I dreamed about her.\n- Did what pushing I could for Alice to guard the North Shore while Charles wasn't here. I hope she gives him a run for his money on it, I think people like having someone 'innocent' in place there, we just need to make sure she gets good guidance if she stays\n- Guided plotting for next game. Made sure Jack and Cyrus (and to a lesser extent Brandi) were on it. \n- Talked to Cyrus, gave my blessing to be involved in the Hunt memories. Really wish the Keeper had been a bit more chill, he really took Cyrus's absence personally.",
server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:1597:            "The family should continue living and establishing themselves, making themselves at home and part of the community, generally building their own safe space, with access to their culture for themselves and the children.\n\nIt is Orthodox Easter on the weekend of the 12th. Anichka urges her family to go if they're feeling it, especially if it will help create ties among the community and all that good shit.\n\nShe also asks them to get her a shovel, please, one for heavy duty use."
server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:1620:        "game_recount": "- Sat in a corner a lot and did handicrafts. Now all the Crone present (and Charlie) have ribbons from the hunt. Alice helped, so she'll be in any resonance from them, too.\n- Shook hands with a lot of people, especially some of the newcomers\n- Met the Bishop, that was hilarious\n- Met the Keeper's LS interest, Carver. He's interesting, and only here to learn about the past. A bit like me on that one. Mentioned the old Altar. May wanna touch base about that\n- Talked to Tegan ha ha she was not happy I dreamed about her.\n- Did what pushing I could for Alice to guard the North Shore while Charles wasn't here. I hope she gives him a run for his money on it, I think people like having someone 'innocent' in place there, we just need to make sure she gets good guidance if she stays\n- Guided plotting for next game. Made sure Jack and Cyrus (and to a lesser extent Brandi) were on it. \n- Talked to Cyrus, gave my blessing to be involved in the Hunt memories. Really wish the Keeper had been a bit more chill, he really took Cyrus's absence personally.",
