server\scripts\archive\_backups\cycle-id-migration-2026-06-01T05-52-47-723Z.json:8985:          "ic_correspondence": "Dear Journal,\n\n\"what happened at courts that new member of ours, I feel absolutely embarrassed, can not recall his name, am information broker I should work on knowing other kindlerd names. My emotions are getting the better of me probably why dont recall his name, dressed in an orange suit, abit of sore eye on how he dressed. Regardless, I sincerely hope he has better control of his vampire nature's, I can relate when I was young kindlerd myself, the lack of control is definitely something to overcome, especially when feeding we must always be aware of vampric natures and keeping them in check\"",
