server\scripts\_facts-C.json:311:        "value": "Views the Traditions and Elysium as merely practical rules deserving no special reverence, and will exploit or break them when warranted. Comfortable with extreme violence in service of his principles; still feels close to humanity and gets involved in mortal affairs more than most Kindred would.",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:2124:   "project_1_description": "As ludica always does keeping to the ally ways and areas that are not so obvious to everyone. she uses her wits attribute  and using her occult knowledge and Auspex to see if anyone has been around the Habour doing unusual activities in occult practices.\n\n\nLudica is using her occult knowledge to look for unusual cultist activities while patrolling the area, knowledge on blood magic through her specialization on bloodlines.\n\nLudica is using her Auspex to sense what has happened in the Harbour recently.\n\nShe using her wits with quick thinking to gather imfromation in the area.",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:3196:   "project_4_description": "The explosive information in the dossier looks robust and detailed. The more detailed, the more leads to follow for veracity, and the exponentially harder it gets to be faked. So I am following the trail by seeing where it touches the flow of money, influence, or a trail that leaves electronic receipts and touches. So I use my expertise in Forensic Accounting and what I know of Motives to looks for those connections. \n\nThis thesis is not exactly falsifiable in the strictest sense, but any supporting evidence from outside this context, especially financial, no matter how small, is SOLID confirmation of veracity.",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:4543:   "personal_story_text": "To my sire,\n\nThis last month gone I have learned the phrase 'Rex Nemorensis', and I shuddered without realising it. We have similar at home, of course, but to hear it spoken of, meet one who has taken part, that is something different. I shy away from such a thought, but I think, if I am older and wiser, I might take comfort in something like that. If it were my tradition, anyway.\n\nWe have uncovered much about the Old Temple. With the longest night coming upon us, we will work together to reawaken the old energies. I hope there will be enough of us, I think some are busy with their own worship and business. I am not angry at their business, but I will be watching, especially because I have been talking about this for months.\n\nThe energy flows of the Regencies recognise me now. I think I have trampled over something that was already there in the North, and I wonder if I should try to find out what that is, instead of imposing my own will upon it. This is not my land, and if I am to care for it, I must not break what is already here. \n\nOne of my family, the Keeper of Memory (that the dreams have given the name Riverkin), surely you have met him sometime, has taken on a mantle of Godhood. The Void flows through him, and his eyes shine with the secrets of the Weave of Fate. I hope that people will take their risks on the answers. His strength is necessary, but I know he is a danger to us sometimes. I can only do so much to steer him before he breaks the halter he has gifted us with. He worries me, but I will be guided by him as he is guided by me, and he meets my gentle hand with his firm one. It makes me wonder if I should reach for an apotheosis of my own. I know the little ones have seen, and will ask for guidance for their own. But there is still much happening here, in the ground and on the wind and the water, things I must see with these eyes. The city needs their Mother- Riverkin has said as much as well- and my own journey must be tied to that, to the roots of this land, rather than the branches of my own divinity.\n\nThe dreams continue. Recently I have dreamed of a trickster's woman. She has shown me her claws, like a harpy. She is given to laugh at any who claim authority. She is here, embodied, and she has allowed me to see her. She knows I am here from the dreams, and that I have come not for my own sake. I think I will see her again. I think she will find me if she needs me. I think I could work with or for her if she wishes.\n\nBefore court, I am setting out to dream of a path for one of my flock. It was taken from this land, and knows the names it wishes to seek out, but not how. I have read about these names, and where they have come from. This is a dangerous path, because the ways here are closed to outsiders. I will ask with respect, and with reverence, but if you do not hear from me for a time, understand that I have asked poorly. \n\nThe Darkest Night will be upon us shortly, and the Moon will shine their crescent smile upon us. I know it is the opposite with you there, and I give offerings for your survival in that awful time. It is strange to be at opposites with you, but it's like it was always meant to be this way. \n\nGive the rosemary a fish for me, and when Halyna is next with you, give her a kiss for me\n\nI remain your childe,\nAnichka",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:4547:   "game_recount_2": "Talked to Tegan about maybe she should visit Tasmania, really hyping her up to try and be independent, especially seeing as her sire said to not go there. Trying to get her be more critical of stuff her sire did and said and how he behaved towards her. ",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:4555:   "game_recount": "1. Confronted Ryan Ambrose about frankly offensive comments about the Invictus vs Crone story in her background. Discussion with Reed Justice, Ryan, and the Keeper continued until Keeper offered to show Ryan what Anichka had been through. That happened and Ryan was real fucked up over it. Anichka hopes it helps him be more of an adult.\n\n2. Talked to Tegan about maybe she should visit Tasmania, really hyping her up to try and be independent, especially seeing as her sire said to not go there. Trying to get her be more critical of stuff her sire did and said and how he behaved towards her.\n\n3. Complained a lot about Conrad trying to pass off getting a lock of (the host) Rene's hair as a 'trivial' thing. Blew cover about some rituals needing locks of hair or something personal but you know what, people have gotta learn.\n\n4. Spent various time explaining what Keeper had been through, and what that meant. Was kinda obnoxious about it to Conrad, but Conrad's existence gets up Anichka's nose :D\n\n5. Brief Crone meeting. Wan Yelong was discussed (it was the end of the night, so I don't know how much or what was discussed, as I was starting to lose focus, it's also stuff she doesn't feel like she doesn't need to be involved with). Anichka said she wanted to make Charlie a member of the Crone, people didn't like that, she realised they were right.",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:4578:   "vamping": "The night after game is Winter Solstice, and Anichka intends to spend it with her family. She communicates with each of them that she wants to get them useful, meaningful gifts that they might not want to spend money on for themselves. Observing some of the old traditions she's held with them in a new land. The three younger members of the family receive special care and attention.\n------\nWhile she's up at her Haven, Anichka spends a night in deep preparation for special dreaming. She gathers together sticks and eucalyptus leaves to make a smoking bundle as the offering, and decorates with blooming flowers. Once it is gathered and smouldering, she prostrates herself.\n\n\"I seek communion with the spirit of the Illapurinja, the Changed One. I know I am an outsider, and this is not business of my mob. I come to learn, to do what is correct for my people. I have someone who asks for my advice. It does not remember if it is mob, but when it remembers family, mob is who it remembers. It says it remembers the name Kurdaitcha, the Featherfoot, and seeks a path forward to learn more. I know this is men's business, so I ask, honoured Illapurinja, would it be correct for me seek Kurdaitcha in dreams for this seeker of mine? I am but a tool for it to find its belief, its path. I would be honoured if you would show me how to help it\"\n\nShe lets the smoking bundle smoulder out, sleeps above ground, in a nook among the rocks that gets no light, so that she can receive dreams through the stones and through the air both.\n====\nAnichka will be attending Brandy's Heraean Games, and has given the OK for that to be held at the Temple",
server\scripts\_dt4-submissions.json:8769:   "personal_story_text": "To an old Carthian contact in Scandinavia, comms code name V. Checking about the trustworthiness of Eivar and especially any Invictus links we might not be aware of. Tone is ‘professional’ but paranoid; espionage, opsec, playing it close to the vest. ",
server\scripts\_facts-A.json:325:        "value": "Incredibly conservative in his adherence to the Book of Longinus and intolerant of anyone straying from it, especially within his own covenant; aims to maintain ideological purity and extinguish blasphemy. Holds the three Traditions as commandments never to be broken.",
server\scripts\_facts-B.json:118:        "value": "Views the Traditions as useful only insofar as they further his motives, especially using others' breaches to gain social power. Revels in the sanctity of Elysium where physical threats are lessened, and regards mortals as resources, food and numbers in an equation.",
server\scripts\_facts-B.json:203:        "value": "A former heavy cocaine user, he especially likes to feed off Kine who are high. He holds and participates in raucous drug-fuelled orgies and always offers narcotics to his intended victims. He will not work with or feed on animals or children.",
server\scripts\_dt1-links-C.json:427:    "outcome": "North Shore foot traffic is up, especially around a well-organised night market, while street-level crime is down noticeably, not through visible policing but as though something moved through the territory.",
server\scripts\_dt1-links-B.json:6:    "intent": "Discreetly learn Eve Lockridge's downtime actions, especially her territory.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:474:   "travel": "I walk from the nearest train station. Under \"Face in the Crowd\". No special precautions. If anyone gets too close a flash of Dread Presence normally get them looking at their feet. There is no ruse entourage this time. No one noticed last time.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:530:   "project_1_description": "This is done by not using my Contacts (Underworld) for information gathering this DT. Instead, they are pushing info out through the \"Wet-Interrogator\" aligned channels, as I will pick up \"kindred\" associated work - something easy and lightweight to touch the network rather than overtly announce our presence!. That is to say, there are those amongst the great unwashed who some wealthy clients pay to have discretely extracted. If Xavier also maintains his PT this DT we will likely then take a 'Carthian' job together - to \"catch and release\" a trouble-maker. Our specialty!",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:980:     "response": "You push the work out through the Wet-Interrogator channels rather than through your Underworld lines this month. The job that comes back is a catch-and-release on one of the Great Unwashed, the kind your specialty was built for. The work is light enough to keep your hand in and quiet enough not to announce you. The Great Unwashed do not yet know your name. They will know there is someone, and the someone is not Ballsack.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:2350:   "game_recount_2": "Argued with the \"Protector\" about their methods of investigating, especially with the threats levelled out about maintaining regencies",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:2489:   "game_recount": "1. Discovered Einar Solveig had an accident in the Harbour Regency\n\n2. Argued with the \"Protector\" about their methods of investigating, especially with the threats levelled out about maintaining regencies\n\n3. Took Etsy under my wing for tutelage, as ordered by Rene St Dominique",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:3508:   "project_1_description": "Jack spends time to check in with his Visitors (humans who maintain the surveillance web for the Room), praising those who have done well, chastising those who have not, using his Auspex to probe their minds to secure truthful compliance; and announces that he has a special challenge and reward for the most dedicated Visitor to motivate them (see DT 2).",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:4701:     "response": "You have spent the better part of the month gliding above Rene, the watch is quiet but it suits you.\nOver time, you get used to tracking Rene by the colourful beret. Especially at night your eyes are sharp for a raven. \nThen one night you follow her, the evening is routine. You drop to a low branch close enough to read her at proper range and the creature before you has no predator taint upon her. \nShe is a mortal in a red beret who has never been Rene. Try as you might, you do not find Rene that night.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:4734:   "feeding_description": "(Just letting you know that I can't unselect a discipline once selected- I've made a bug report about it- I'll use it this time but let's hope I don't get a failure, huh?)\n\nRene walks the venues of the second city, for those people drinking alone- for the dates that haven't shown up, for the people who need someone and don't really care who. Picking the best target with Auspex, she slips in like a sigh and asks them about their troubles. She listens, for a time, perhaps buys them a drink and offers to walk with them for some air... Eventually, in a secluded place, she'll bring them close and offer a shoulder to cry on before getting what she really needs- all the troubles they expounded discarded in favour of sweet vitae. \n\nAs they are regaining their wits, she makes a calm exit.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:4758:   "project_1_xp_trait": "(I assume I can pick up Court Jester as it's a 2 dot merit that's not got any specific actions that are required, but I will be using an action to bump professional training. For the 3rd dot of professional training I'm going to be picking the new asset skill 'Larceny' with the specialties of 'Larceny: Pickpocketing' and 'Empathy: Motives', which I hope to explain in my IC reasoning. I've not actually got that many skills I can specialize in/make an asset, so I tried to pick some I thought appropriate.)\n\nI've got my footing on Sydney now, and though I've my hands full with the regency- I've time enough now to resume the work that still somewhat connects me to my past self. The process of constructing collective action can be undertaken in a myriad of ways- I knew some people back in England who would work closely with the companies they organized against to find an appropriate middle ground all could be happy with.\n\nI never worked like that- and since my indoctrination into these ruthless and bloody nights, I feel that was the correct choice; There can be no compromises- I will bring to bare the grievances of the worker and if so refused, will find other ways of getting my point across... even if that means pocketing the company-man's wallet and paying him a visit at his listed address during the small hours of the night. That's how you get change, by demonstrating the walls of process immaterial. \n\nTonight I'm meeting with some union men who have grown comfortable in the city that has until now been bereft of beasts in the night and puppet masters upon the stage. I of course will not let them know the true extent of their hopelessness, but I hope to get across some of the troubles to come- and offer myself as an apt consultant.\n\nI'll gauge their interest and put on a smile, no kindred powers needed. If they dismiss me? I'll do to them what I've done to so many company men, and take their info for a more private conversation.\n\n-\n\nConducting this business I can't help but think how absurd the machinations of court really are. It has been a musing of mine for a while, stuffing mad predators together in a room- all pretending to be moral and chivalrous before ripping each others throats out. I am expected to conduct a real-estate survey after being stabbed in the heart? It's enough to drive a woman to apathy. \n\nAnd so it has. It's obvious I have no touch for etiquette despite my heritage, so I won't pretend. I will face the court with something all the rarer- plain faced and indifferent honesty. Call me foolish if you wish, but at least I'm not pretending to be a knight.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:4765:   "regency_action": "There's been much focus upon the scramble for Sydney over the past months- it is of course ongoing and will surely result in more death and violence, but I wish to highlight the lighter side to all of you whom have come from across the globe. We, united by our complete foreignness to this place, have a type of freedom never seen- especially here in 2C. It is an opportunity to be celebrated.\n\nThe mortals of Sydney are untouched by fear, innocent and fresh. This, of course, makes feeding easy- but I ask you all to consider that there is other nourishment we can gain from them. Nourishment of ideas, of art and musings. I ask you all to engage with them, and not to smother them out in dominative dismissal- we can use them, after all. Soon, court will be hosted in this wonderful territory of ours- and as the night approaches, I hope to see you all prove that we are growing into something distinct from the rest of the world from which we all came. Paint the alleys! Take the stage! Join a chorus! Fit into the space of untainted mortal expression and feed as you would from their veins!\n\nSoon, more Kine come- and with them, their ignorant and wonderful thoughts. We must take care with them.\n\nThey only live once, after all.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:4812:   "project_4_description": "Whatever Keeper is doing seems big- I know as much from the tremors of the cacophony last month. Given that he has also decided to link himself to me in some manner or another,  that might help in working out his movements and motives- especially if I pump some Auspex into it. \n\nIf I can identify any of- where it is happening, why it is happening, how it is happening, or what the fuck is happening, I'll take it is a win. Especially if it gives me any chance to brace for it.\n\nI have spoken a big game in my letter of reply- that the movement lives in me and thus is unquenchable... but to an extent, I fear- this elder seems something other than Kindred, and he has Charlie at his back. A very dour combination. Perhaps using my understanding of the compulsions of our kind, coupled with my experience of these city streets, I can resist this tyranny of ego and weather what is coming.\n\nI also suspect that Conrad may have received a similar letter- and will be on the lookout for the scrawny bastard. \n\nKeeper has warned me of final death if I'm to interrupt him during the process unannounced... so I won't be going alone. Taking Casmirir along should serve to bolster my chances and keep my beast from doing anything unfortunate if it is so badly effected by whatever Keeper has in store.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:5175:   "personal_story_text": "Carver asks James to take him somewhere that is special to him. Somewhere where James feels is a \"core memeory\".",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:8540:   "project_3_description": "On becoming aware of the existence of an old necropolis Xavier starts the search to find it. He reaches out through his various contacts (foreign and domestic) to look for clues to where it might have been. Searched information on subterranean areas across the history of the city (maps, plans, geological surveys). looking for unusual gaps to information about it being accessed (especially old areas that had been more recently accessed during the time vampires were absent from the city). Looking for folklore about usual events linked to these subterranean sites and immediate surrounds.",
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:9532:    "outcome_summary": "You get wind of a special deceased estate auction of a person who is reputed to be a bon fide soothsayer. You wonder how credible it is, Vaucluse is not known for mystics."
server\scripts\_dt3-submissions.json:10302:      "text": "It's all good in the hood, especially the parties.",
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:155:    "description": "Reed is looking to improve security around his haven, especially with moving to a new building. He is looking to also make some remotely controlled doors and blinds to help move in and around during the day."
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:264:    "description": "The network of influence in Politics and Finance that is the MMN cult reaps its rewards in greased palms. The right bribe, the right contract, the right environmental report. Volia - whole chunks of subterranean tunnels sealed off with special works here - accidental concrete spill there, sealed off for the M11 tunnel. Tunnels, mostly bare, ugly, damp, infested. But directly underneath and nowhere all at once! It is a patchwork of forgotten RTA service tunnels, WW2 shuttered ammunition tunnels, redundant storm-water catchment sumps, etc... It is not ownership per se. It is sealing the entry points off little clusters and burying them administratively so they are nobody's business."
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:270:   "aspirations": "Yusuf feels isolated and unsupported. The Mammon Cult (MMN) is in formative stage, but I dont really have any surety to bother building it up just for someone else to take. At the same time I have not been subtle with its presence. The cult served its initial purpose - the contrivance to get me to Sydney. It stands out as a target. Perhaps I will set it up at this stage as a honey-pot to lure investigation and actions of other kindred. I see the cult as a presently useful expendable asset.\n\nI am guest everywhere, marginalised even in the Covenant. Yusuf has a job here in Sydney - to protect Brandy. But he sees both her and Eve witless puppets on a string of more organised powers. A dangerous predicament. Yusuf must help himself first. Hence taking OBS5. And working on his lair. Mt plans are to get safe and embedded. This court seems like a dangerours and specially curated fishbowl designed to fail. I worry about the consequences for the Carthian Movement. I fear we have been trojan horsed by Eve with a plan to humiliate the movement on the global stage as the \"Carthian Experiment\" fails spectacularly.\n\nIt is unlikely building clan status within the Carthians will be viable. They are riven, misguided and working against their own interests. Eve has already cleverly seen to that. Handing out boons to those who are giddy with the proximity to praxis and ignoring those not actively bending knee. The younger Carthians in the movement seem enthusiastic to embrace a \"lets see hoe THEY like it attitude, rather than a lets do this properly\".\n\nThe City status game is meta-unstable and already stitched up. There are inner and outer cliques quickly forming and Yusuf sees no way into the inner cliques. So Yusuf must build.... \nwith what he has left in the space left to him. THE SEWERS.\n\nThe sewers and catacombs in the territory no one bothered wanting... with his Clan - the Nosferatu.  There are not many Nos, and they don't usually play well - not with others and not with themselves. I will make a place in the catacombs. I will open it to others of my kind. I will see who will come to the Necropolis once it is built. The first bricks are laid in this downtime.\n\nSHORT: GET MYSELF SAFE\nMEDIUM: BUILD THE NOS, PROTECT MMN\nLONG: NECROPOLIS UNDER THEIR FEET"
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:432:    "description": "Project Name: Who do I call?\nCharacters involved: me and Yusuf\nMerits & Bonuses:\nXP Spend: n/a\nProject description: Yusuf asked if I could help him find a connection to get some mil spec surveillance cameras. Fortunately (as he well knew…) I know a guy from my time in the military and the professional connections I have maintained back in the US. I called around and got him a name of someone who could help him out. He is so lucky he has me around…again grand ideas are one thing but landing it is my speciality."
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:467:    "description": "Project Name:  The Panopticon\nCharacters involved: Just me\nMerits & Bonuses:  Trained Observer\nXP spend: n/a\nProject Description: \n\nJack has been tasked with securing the venue for Court on April 18th. He applies his skills as a director to surveil Court.  \n\nThrough his High Society Allies, he negotiates permission from the owner (acquired for $25M in 2024) of a The Hub Theatre (shuttered and closed in 1996) on King Street in Newtown to allow him to put on a small exhibit for a dry run of a private viewing (Court), which he intends to repeat as an extended special exhibit during next DT for high society members (Moulding Room shenanigans). \n\n[full description of Court setup will be sent to STs] \nThe Exhibit consists of projectors with small screens and seats arranged around the art deco ballroom of the theatre profiling visual media over the past century of the Theatre's history -- vaudeville, silent movies, early black and white, colorised film, porn productions in the 70s/80s, and ultimately nothing from ~1996 onwards. The Final Exhibit shows a live feed, top down, of a camera with a LENSBABY Composer 2 Pro Bending Camera Lens mounted on the ceiling that shows the movement of Kindred around the ballroom, blurred focus around the edges by clear focus on the centre -- which is where the central seat for the Premier is located. [Primary dice pool to set up]\n\nWith his Eye Behind the Glass detournement active (on a camera in his Haven watching the feed from Court), Jack would be able to constantly keep an eye on that central spot of Court (who is talking to the Premier, and for how long) and gain some insights on the machinations of Court. [Secondary dice pool]"
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:544:    "description": "Project Name: A Strange Occurence\nCharacters involved: Cazz, Lucinda \nMerits & Bonuses: \nXP Spend: n/a\nProject description: Cazz and Lucinda met up at UNSW earlier in the month, to talk privately about the shared 'bad vibes' felt across Sydney the month prior. During Court, it was discovered at least three other vampires felt this, across multiple territories. So, who was Cazz not to follow an interesting thing?\nLucinda seems to be better at actual investigations, so, Cazz thought to start with their speciality, dipping into their specific Occult knowledge. And its always good to get a lay of the lines anyway, ey?"
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:550:    "description": "Project Name: Second City Vibe Check\nCharacters involved: Just me\nMerits & Bonuses:  Face In The Crowd\nXP Spend: n/a\nProject description: Cazz usually spents time in the Academy. The Second City is a whole new area to see what the area is like, who stays here, who doesn't, and try to not be noticed too hard. Don't need to show up and be loud, especially if we Carthains are gonna look after this place. Ooh, and there's a University here! Excellent. Whose here?"
server\scripts\_dt2-submissions.json:579:    "description": "Project Name: Keeping it Tight\nCharacters involved: Me and Mac (Also: Jack, Keeper, Anichka, Cyrus) \nMerits and Bonuses: N/A\nXP Spent: N/A\nProject Description: I’ve been invited by Jack to patrol the Academy for poachers and interlopers, which I’ll certainly do, but what I’m really interested in is information. Last month I learned from my political contacts that the Academy is ‘on the radar’. I’d like to see if there’s anything I could match to that information. Any places that look like they could use the investment of the Covenant that’s to be looking after this territory. And especially, anything that directly contradicts the information that I already have. All this with an eye to being able to make intelligent, evidenced recommendations to Jack next Court."
